---
slug: test/mcp-request-summary
method: post
format: json
---
{%- comment -%}
  TEST FIXTURE (gated): returns modules/mcp/helpers/rpc/request_summary for this very
  request, as the /mcp page logs it for a refused request (status 400 with a JSON-RPC
  error), so tests/request-log.test.mjs can check the summary without waiting for the
  instance log, which can arrive hours late. Served only when MCP_ENABLE_TEST_TOOLS is
  '1'/'true' (CI + eval hosts).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign test_gate = context.constants.MCP_ENABLE_TEST_TOOLS | default: ''
  if test_gate == '1' or test_gate == 'true'
    function body = 'modules/mcp/helpers/rpc/error', id: context.params.id, code: -32022, message: 'Unsupported protocol version'
    function summary = 'modules/mcp/helpers/rpc/request_summary', params: context.params, headers: context.headers, status: 400, body: body
    echo summary
  else
    response_status 404
    echo '{}'
  endif
-%}
